  ('Rabat | Ouazzane | Chefchaouen', 'Drive to Chefchaouen via Ouazzane, passing through the fertile Gharb plain. Explore Rabat first: Oudayas Kasbah, Hassan Tower, and Mohammed V Mausoleum. Arrive in Chefchaouen in late afternoon.'),
